<BaseLayout
  title="黄仁勋事件：事实时间线与推送材料"
  description="2026 年 10 月底至 11 月 18 日的公开报道时间线、11 张微信推送截图与 18 条原文索引。"
>
  <div class="huang-page" id="top">
    <header class="h-hero">
      <p class="h-eyebrow">事件整理 · EVENT DOSSIER</p>
      <h1>黄仁勋事件</h1>
      <p class="h-sub">事实时间线与推送材料</p>
      <p class="h-desc">
        按时间顺序整理 2026 年 10 月底至 11 月 18 日的公开报道节点、11 张微信推送截图与 18 条原文链接。
        本页只呈现事实与材料，分析框架与判断不在此展开。
      </p>
      <div class="h-meta">
        <span>2026.10 — 11.18</span>
        <span>10 个日期</span>
        <span>11 张截图</span>
        <span>18 篇原文</span>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="h-layout">
      <aside class="h-side">
        <p class="h-side-label">导览</p>
        <nav class="h-nav" aria-label="页面导览">
          <a class="on" href="#timeline"><span>01</span>时间线</a>
          <a href="#shots"><span>02</span>推送截图</a>
          <a href="#sources"><span>03</span>原文索引</a>
          <a href="#notes"><span>04</span>材料说明</a>
        </nav>
        <div class="h-side-meta">
          <p>资料范围</p>
          <strong>2026.10 底 — 11.18</strong>
          <p>整理于 2026.11.16</p>
        </div>
      </aside>

      <div class="h-main">
        <section class="h-sec" id="timeline">
          <div class="h-sec-head">
            <p class="h-kicker">01 / TIMELINE</p>
            <h2>事件时间线</h2>
            <p>以推送发布时间与报道所述日期为准。部分节点为多家媒体的连续报道，已合并到同一日期下。</p>
          </div>

          <div class="h-timeline">
            {days.map((day) => (
              <div class="h-day">
                <div class="h-day-date">
                  {day.date}
                  <span>{day.weekday}</span>
                </div>
                <div class="h-day-body">
                  {day.slots.map((slot) => (
                    <article class="h-slot">
                      <div class="h-slot-head">
                        <span class="h-cat">{slot.cat}</span>
                        <span class="h-when">{slot.when}</span>
                      </div>
                      <h3>{slot.title}</h3>
                      <ul>
                        {slot.items.map((item) => <li>{item}</li>)}
                      </ul>
                      {slot.srcs.length > 0 && (
                        <div class="h-src">
                          {slot.srcs.map((src) => (
                            <a href={src.href} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{src.label}</a>
                          ))}
                        </div>
                      )}
                    </article>
                  ))}
                </div>
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="h-sec" id="shots">
          <div class="h-sec-head">
            <p class="h-kicker">02 / SCREENSHOTS</p>
            <h2>推送截图</h2>
            <p>共 11 张，按发布时间排列。截图为推送页面局部，阅读量等数据为截图时状态；点击可放大查看，并可跳转原文。</p>
          </div>

          <div class="h-shots">
            {shots.map((shot) => (
              <button
                type="button"
                class:list={['h-shot', shot.no === '03' && 'is-wide']}
                data-shot
                data-full={withBase(shot.img)}
                data-title={shot.title}
                data-meta={`${shot.account} · ${shot.date}`}
                data-href={shot.href}
              >
                <span class="h-shot-im">
                  <img src={withBase(shot.img)} alt={`${shot.account}推送截图`} loading="lazy" />
                  <span class="h-shot-no">{shot.no}</span>
                </span>
                <span class="h-shot-cap">
                  <span class="h-shot-title">{shot.title}</span>
                  <span class="h-shot-meta">
                    <span>{shot.account}</span>
                    <span>{shot.date}</span>
                  </span>
                </span>
              </button>
            ))}
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="h-sec" id="sources">
          <div class="h-sec-head">
            <p class="h-kicker">03 / SOURCES</p>
            <h2>原文索引</h2>
            <p>共 18 条，按发布时间排序。账号名以截图显示为准；未截图核对的条目仅标注“微信推送”。</p>
          </div>

          {groups.map((group) => (
            <div class="h-group">
              <h3>{group.label}</h3>
              {group.items.map((item) => (
                <a class="h-item" href={item.href} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                  <span class="h-item-date">{item.date}</span>
                  <span class="h-item-body">
                    <span class="h-item-title">
                      {item.title}
                      {item.warn && <em class="h-warn">需验证</em>}
                    </span>
                    <span class="h-item-account">{item.account}</span>
                  </span>
                  <span class="h-item-arrow">↗</span>
                </a>
              ))}
            </div>
          ))}
        </section>

        <section class="h-sec" id="notes">
          <div class="h-sec-head">
            <p class="h-kicker">04 / NOTES</p>
            <h2>材料说明</h2>
            <p>以下四项为引用与核对时需要注意的口径问题。</p>
          </div>

          <div class="h-notes">
            {notes.map((note, i) => (
              <div class="h-note">
                <span class="h-note-no">{String(i + 1).padStart(2, '0')}</span>
                <h3>{note.title}</h3>
                <p>{note.text}</p>
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>

          <div class="h-related">
            <p>相关阅读</p>
            <a href={withBase('/posts/huang-resignation/')}>
              下台不到 48 小时，23 万人请他回来：黄仁勋事件背后的三层棋局
              <span>↗</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </section>

        <footer class="h-foot">
          <p><b>黄仁勋事件：事实时间线与推送材料</b></p>
          <p>资料范围：2026 年 10 月底至 11 月 18 日；11 张推送截图、18 条微信推送、5 份视频文稿。</p>
          <p>整理日期：2026 年 11 月 16 日。引用请核对原文。</p>
        </footer>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="h-lb" aria-hidden="true">
      <button class="h-lb-close" type="button" aria-label="关闭">×</button>
      <div class="h-lb-body">
        <img src="" alt="" />
        <div class="h-lb-bar">
          <div class="h-lb-text">
            <h4></h4>
            <span></span>
          </div>
          <a href="#" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">打开原文 ↗</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

